some sort of message.

00:01:22.315 --> 00:01:25.952
And he would just take his
family to one of his cabin

00:01:25.952 --> 00:01:27.887 align:start size:94% position:6%
in the woods,
where he was heading anyway,

00:01:27.887 --> 00:01:29.956 align:start size:94% position:6%
and they would just
enjoy, you know, some fishin

00:01:29.956 --> 00:01:34.260 align:start size:94% position:6%
and some items from his garden
until things blew over.

00:01:34.260 --> 00:01:37.097 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, I think we should
all be so lucky

00:01:37.097 --> 00:01:40.300 size:78% position:39%
to have Ron Swanson's
self-preservation.

00:01:40.300 --> 00:01:43.703 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, when the [bleep]
goes down, Ron is all set up

00:01:43.703 --> 00:01:44.604 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
