00:01:44.604 --> 00:01:45.839 align:start size:94% position:6%
Always a pleasure
to see you, my friend.

00:01:45.839 --> 00:01:46.806 align:start size:94% position:6%
Thank you so much
for being here.

00:01:46.806 --> 00:01:49.309 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Thank you so much.
-Nick Offerman.

